<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Heightened Senses</ansi> mutation

Every nerve ending rewires itself. The world becomes sharper, louder,
more vivid — but your body struggles to keep pace with the flood of
input.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately improved perception — every sense sharpens beyond
  normal human range
  Slightly improved willpower from the mental intensity

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced dexterity — the overwhelming input flood makes
  precise movement more difficult

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Sixth Sense

